feat: Phase 2 - Complex widgets (list, typed list, relation, object, image, file)

Complex Widget Components (6):
- CmsList: repeatable field group with simple/single/structured modes
  Handles tags, skills, tools, learningObjectives, attachments, criteria
- CmsTypedList: polymorphic list for typed items
  Handles prerequisites (8 content types) and lesson items (5 types)
  Type selector per item, color-coded type badges, collapsible sections
- CmsRelation: content reference picker via Nuxt Content queries
  Searchable combobox, single and multiple selection modes
  Reorderable tags for multi-select (specializations, pathways)
- CmsObject: nested field group with recursive DynamicField rendering
  Collapsible sections, hidden field defaults
- CmsImage: image upload with drag-and-drop, preview thumbnail, URL fallback
- CmsFile: generic file upload with drag-and-drop, filename display, URL fallback

Media Upload API:
- server/api/cms/media/upload.post.ts: handles multipart file uploads
  Writes to public/uploads in dev mode, sanitized filenames with timestamps

DynamicField Router Updates:
- Registered all Phase 2 components in widget map
- Smart list routing: list with types -> CmsTypedList, otherwise -> CmsList
- All 13 Decap widget types now supported

Milestone: All 10 collections fully editable via custom CMS.
